      "field": "description",
      "value": "The BA program in American Studies at Goethe University focuses on the literature, culture, and history of the USA. It involves analyzing literary texts and non-literary cultural productions and media (such as film) as well as historical sources and discussing their various contemporary and historical significances.",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "source": null,
